; The module is (name main), not (name n88basic): the library n88basic
; generates a wrapper module N88basic, and an executable module of the same
; name would shadow it, so N88basic.Interp would not resolve from here. No
; public_name either — that requires a package definition this project does
; not have yet. The binary is _build/default/bin/main.exe; it acquires the
; name n88basic once packaged for opam.
(executable
 (name main)
 (libraries n88basic raster))
